OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to turn school into three-bed
OL,4,Ahouse approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II listed school is set to get
OL,7,Fa new lease of life after fears it
OL,8,Fwould be lost forever.
OL,10,FCouncillors have approved a plan to
OL,11,Fturn The Old Day School in Bluntisham,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, which has been empty
OL,13,Ffor about five years, into a
OL,14,Fthree-bedroom house.
OL,16,FHuntingdonshire District Council's
OL,17,Fplanning officers had recommended
OL,18,Frefusing the planning application,
OL,19,Fsaying it would cause "substantial"
OL,20,Fharm to the building because the school
OL,21,Fhall would need to be divided to create
OL,22,Fthe third bedroom.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
