OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to turn school into three-bed
OL,4,Ahouse approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeventeen letters supporting the
OL,7,Fproposal had been submitted by
OL,8,Fresidents. The authority's development
OL,9,Fmanagement committee voted 10 to one in
OL,10,Ffavour of the scheme.
